    "about_the_game": "<strong>Welcome to <i>Rumble Runners</i>, the biggest racing event in the entire <u>Cosmos</u>!</strong><br><br><strong>Race, Customise, Build your own Paths and play online against others!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1646880/extras/16cba8ee9d2c2b68a456120c694c0c45.webp?t=1709308511\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1646880/extras/cabe2ae358f7b0923266af9a9d93e296.poster.avif?t=1709308511\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1646880/extras/cabe2ae358f7b0923266af9a9d93e296.webm?t=1709308511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1646880/extras/cabe2ae358f7b0923266af9a9d93e296.mp4?t=1709308511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The path is randomly build as you go!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1646880/extras/a7d92f5a08c95e4663faef7d0699b2d9.avif?t=1709308511\" /></div><br><strong>3! 2! 1! Go! Get ready to Rumble -Run!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1646880/extras/c728025374690982b20cd992137ee25b.avif?t=1709308511\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1646880/extras/f9f93caf99071b671bf4ad0c31e98b1d.avif?t=1709308511\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1646880/extras/2181fe8d9e9aaeea838ccee19bb4f508.avif?t=1709308511\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" sr